<title>USA: Patrick Industries to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Patrick Industries to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>ELKART, Ind. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patrick Industries Inc, a building products maker, said Monday it will repurchase up to one million shares over a one-year period.</p>
<p>The company said its board of directors renewed its stock repurchase program Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said it had a weighted average of about six million shares outstanding in the first quarter.</p>
<p>Patrick shares closed down 1/4 to 13-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
